    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-cadf238a83d31de8ef8b683f",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "z=y 的一阶伺服转速控制系统的对称根轨迹（SRL）。SRL 方程为 1+ρ 1/((-s+a)(s+a))=0。最优（稳定）极点为 s=-sqrt(a^2+ρ)。使性能指标最小的闭环根位置位于实轴上，且始终位于开环根的左侧。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "SRL for a first-order servo speed control system with z=y. The SRL equation is 1+ρ 1/((-s+a)(s+a))=0. The optimal (stable) pole is s=-sqrt(a^2+ρ). The closed-loop root location that minimizes the performance index lies on the real axis and is always to the left of the open-loop root.",
